      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$\mathbf{r}{(t)} = {({3 - 4t})}\mathbf{i} + {({4 + 3t})}\mathbf{j} + {({2 - 6t})}\mathbf{k}$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
