        <paragraph>$$\int_{0}^{1}\left( {\frac{1}{t + 1}\mathbf{i} + \frac{1}{t^{2} + 1}\mathbf{j} + \frac{t}{t^{2} + 1}\mathbf{k}} \right)dt$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$${({\ln 2})}\mathbf{i} + {({\pi \slash 4})}\mathbf{j} + \frac{1}{2}\ln 2\mathbf{k}$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
