      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$\tan^{- 1}t\mathbf{i} + \frac{1}{2}e^{t^{2}}\mathbf{j} + \frac{2}{3}t^{3/2}\mathbf{k} + \mathbf{C}$$</paragraph>
